<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan 3, 6-mth T-bill yields rise at auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan 3, 6-mth T-bill yields rise at auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three and six-month Sri Lankan treasury bills rose and 12-month yields remained unchanged at Wednesday's auction with bids amounting to 7,263 million being received, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  bids received   bids accepted   avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     3,345	     2,370	  18.08 (17.89)</p>
<p>    6 months	 205		  30	  17.98 (17.91)</p>
<p>    12 months    3,713	     1,893	  17.98 (17.98)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
